   <media:description>Dr. Matthew Disney, institute professor and chair of the Department of Chemistry at the @WertheimUFScrippsInstitute, delivers the keynote address at the summer 2026 commencement ceremonies. 

In his speech, Matthew Disney encourages graduates to keep learning, embrace change and trust their ability to adapt. He urged them to learn from failure, use their time wisely, show up for others, finish what they start and use their UF education and talents to make a difference and pay it forward.</media:description>
